{"id":"wb-7-1484","name":"银川玉皇阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"银川玉皇阁","text":"银川玉皇阁，位于宁夏回族自治区银川市兴庆区，前身为明朝建立的钟鼓楼，后曾一度荒废，清朝乾隆三年（1738年）时被改为玉皇阁。中华人民共和国成立后，玉皇阁的台基一度被刷满红漆。1963年和2013年，银川玉皇阁先后被列为宁夏回族自治区重点文物保护单位和全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%93%B6%E5%B7%9D%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81","revisionId":94360212,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94360212","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/65e499d2193105f56be65201.jpg","title":"20260810_Yinchuan_Yuhuang_Pavilion_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260810_Yinchuan_Yuhuang_Pavilion_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/20260810_Yinchuan_Yuhuang_Pavilion_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 银川玉皇阁","width":320,"height":213}}